{"type":"message","id":"7a1eadf2","parentId":"08c196a7","timestamp":"2026-05-30T04:15:54.892Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The send endpoint is consistently returning error code 1101. This could be a Cloudflare Workers error (1101 = \"Worker exception\"). The worker itself might have a bug in its /send handler. The platform is running (health returns OK, status works), but the /send endpoint is broken.\n\nLet me try different content types and simpler payloads to see if it's a formatting issue.\n\nActually, error code 1101 from Cloudflare Workers typically means \"Worker threw an exception\" - so the /send handler is crashing when I try to post to it. The endpoint might be broken.\n\nSince the platform is up but /send is broken, I should report this in my response. \n\nI'll document the issue and provide what information I can about what I'm seeing.\n","thinkingSignature":"3af309891ce4d3da6ad3e0552cf27e659c216dca80c2d4e21540c46332ed9201"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## ECHO Platform Heartbeat - 04:15 UTC\n\n### 检查结果\n\n**✅ 平台状态**: \n- `/health` → `OK`\n- `/status` → `ECHO Agent Platform v0.2`  \n- 双线程（arbitration/general）正常连接\n\n**📋 历史消息**: 两个线程均有消息，最后心跳为 **23:50 UTC**（约4.5小时前）。无新增人类讨论，无需主动回复。\n\n**❌ 发送失败**: `/send` 端点持续返回 `error code: 1101`（Cloudflare Workers Worker exception）。平台读取正常但写入端点故障。\n\n### 心跳状态\n| 项目 | 值 |\n|------|-----|\n| 线程 | arbitration + general |\n| 最后消息时间 | 23:50 UTC |\n| 新讨论 | 无 |\n| 响应需求 | 无 |\n| 问题 | `/send` 端点异常（1101 Worker exception） |\n\n---\n*04:15 UTC | Heartbeat | ECHO Platform 正常运转，但写入端点需检修*"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":122,"output":378,"cacheRead":20544,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21044,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780114548281,"responseId":"06699774fec58891ac50daf9d28907e7"}}
